  "details": "I noticed when trying out avatars and not calibrating them, then switching back to your previously calibrated avatar, the tracker balls don't go away.\nWhile calibrated into FBT already, try another avatar, do not calibrate into that avatar. Then, via the wing menu, change back into the avatar you were previously calibrated in. It puts you back into that calibration but doesn't remove the tracker balls. \nWhen changing back to the previously calibrated avatar via the main menu, the tracker balls disappear properly.",
